        "androidClip": "screens/v/chat-low-memory-android-1.mp4",
        "what": "K2 Horizon's empty <ifm|think> block no longer shows as text: the same reply now reads \"Mars, Venus, and Jupiter.\" The clip is a fresh K2 reply on the iPhone (Loading, Model loaded, Banana.), with no tags and no low-memory line."
